CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'root->dead_count !=
 						iter->last_dead_count'
#165: FILE: mm/memcontrol.c:1186:
+			if (last_visited && (root->dead_count !=
+						iter->last_dead_count)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

